The program structure was improved by separating the main logic into different functions.
The input validation was moved to a separate function called `validate_input`, which checks if the field is empty, numeric, and not negative.
The calculation logic was also placed in a separate function called `calculate_square`.
The event handler function now only coordinates the process by calling the validation and calculation functions.
Meaningful variable names were used to make the code easier to understand and maintain.
The program was also organized using a class structure, which improves code readability and organization
